===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Someone or something that [[catches]].
# {{baseball}} The player that squats behind [[home plate]] and receives the pitches from the [[pitcher]]
# {{chiefly|US}} {{LGBT|slang}} The [[submissive]] or quasi-female partner in a [[homosexual]] relationship between two male prisoners.

